{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْمُرْسَلَاتِ","d":"wal-mur'salāti","e":"By the ones sent forth"},{"c":"عُرْفًا","d":"ʿur'fan","e":"one after another"}],"a":{"g":"By those [winds] sent forth in gusts"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْعَاصِفَاتِ","d":"fal-ʿāṣifāti","e":"And the winds that blow"},{"c":"عَصْفًا","d":"ʿaṣfan","e":"violently"}],"a":{"g":"And the winds that blow violently"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَالنَّاشِرَاتِ","d":"wal-nāshirāti","e":"And the ones that scatter"},{"c":"نَشْرًا","d":"nashran","e":"far and wide"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the winds that spread [clouds]"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْفَارِقَاتِ","d":"fal-fāriqāti","e":"And those who separate"},{"c":"فَرْقًا","d":"farqan","e":"(by the) Criterion"}],"a":{"g":"And those [angels] who bring criterion"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْمُلْقِيَاتِ","d":"fal-mul'qiyāti","e":"And those who bring down"},{"c":"ذِكْرًا","d":"dhik'ran","e":"(the) Reminder"}],"a":{"g":"And those [angels] who deliver a message"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"عُذْرًا","d":"ʿudh'ran","e":"(As) justification"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"نُذْرًا","d":"nudh'ran","e":"warning"}],"a":{"g":"As justification or warning,"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Indeed what"},{"c":"تُوعَدُونَ","d":"tūʿadūna","e":"you are promised"},{"c":"لَوَاقِعٌ","d":"lawāqiʿun","e":"will surely occur"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, what you are promised is to occur."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"So when"},{"c":"النُّجُومُ","d":"l-nujūmu","e":"the stars"},{"c":"طُمِسَتْ","d":"ṭumisat","e":"are obliterated"}],"a":{"g":"So when the stars are obliterated"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"فُرِجَتْ","d":"furijat","e":"is cleft asunder"}],"a":{"g":"And when the heaven is opened"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"الْجِبَالُ","d":"l-jibālu","e":"the mountains"},{"c":"نُسِفَتْ","d":"nusifat","e":"are blown away"}],"a":{"g":"And when the mountains are blown away"}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"الرُّسُلُ","d":"l-rusulu","e":"the Messengers"},{"c":"أُقِّتَتْ","d":"uqqitat","e":"are gathered to their appointed time"}],"a":{"g":"And when the messengers' time has come..."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"لِأَيِّ","d":"li-ayyi","e":"For what"},{"c":"يَوْمٍ","d":"yawmin","e":"Day"},{"c":"أُجِّلَتْ","d":"ujjilat","e":"are (these) postponed"}],"a":{"g":"For what Day was it postponed?"}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"لِيَوْمِ","d":"liyawmi","e":"For (the) Day"},{"c":"الْفَصْلِ","d":"l-faṣli","e":"(of) Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"For the Day of Judgement."}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"will make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الْفَصْلِ","d":"l-faṣli","e":"(of) the Judgment"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is the Day of Judgement?"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"نُهْلِكِ","d":"nuh'liki","e":"We destroy"},{"c":"الْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"l-awalīna","e":"the former (people)"}],"a":{"g":"Did We not destroy the former peoples?"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"نُتْبِعُهُمُ","d":"nut'biʿuhumu","e":"We follow them up"},{"c":"الْءَاخِرِينَ","d":"l-ākhirīna","e":"(with) the later ones"}],"a":{"g":"Then We will follow them with the later ones."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"نَفْعَلُ","d":"nafʿalu","e":"We deal"},{"c":"بِالْمُجْرِمِينَ","d":"bil-muj'rimīna","e":"with the criminals"}],"a":{"g":"Thus do We deal with the criminals."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"نَخْلُقْكُمْ","d":"nakhluqkkum","e":"We create you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مَاءٍ","d":"māin","e":"a water"},{"c":"مَهِينٍ","d":"mahīnin","e":"despicable"}],"a":{"g":"Did We not create you from a liquid disdained?"}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"فَجَعَلْنَاهُ","d":"fajaʿalnāhu","e":"Then We placed it"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"قَرَارٍ","d":"qarārin","e":"an abode"},{"c":"مَكِينٍ","d":"makīnin","e":"safe"}],"a":{"g":"And We placed it in a firm lodging"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"For"},{"c":"قَدَرٍ","d":"qadarin","e":"a period"},{"c":"مَعْلُومٍ","d":"maʿlūmin","e":"known"}],"a":{"g":"For a known extent."}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"فَقَدَرْنَا","d":"faqadarnā","e":"So We measured"},{"c":"فَنِعْمَ","d":"faniʿ'ma","e":"and Best"},{"c":"الْقَادِرُونَ","d":"l-qādirūna","e":"(are We to) measure!"}],"a":{"g":"And We determined [it], and excellent [are We] to determine."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Have not"},{"c":"نَجْعَلِ","d":"najʿali","e":"We made"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"كِفَاتًا","d":"kifātan","e":"a receptacle"}],"a":{"g":"Have We not made the earth a container"}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"أَحْيَاءً","d":"aḥyāan","e":"(For the) living"},{"c":"وَأَمْوَاتًا","d":"wa-amwātan","e":"and (the) dead"}],"a":{"g":"Of the living and the dead?"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَعَلْنَا","d":"wajaʿalnā","e":"And We made"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"رَوَاسِيَ","d":"rawāsiya","e":"firmly set mountains"},{"c":"شَامِخَاتٍ","d":"shāmikhātin","e":"lofty"},{"c":"وَأَسْقَيْنَاكُمْ","d":"wa-asqaynākum","e":"and We gave you to drink"},{"c":"مَاءً","d":"māan","e":"water"},{"c":"فُرَاتًا","d":"furātan","e":"sweet"}],"a":{"g":"And We placed therein lofty, firmly set mountains and have given you to drink sweet water."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"انْطَلِقُوا","d":"inṭaliqū","e":"Proceed"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"in it"},{"c":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","d":"tukadhibūna","e":"(to) deny"}],"a":{"g":"[They will be told], \"Proceed to that which you used to deny."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"انْطَلِقُوا","d":"inṭaliqū","e":"Proceed"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"ظِلٍّ","d":"ẓillin","e":"a shadow"},{"c":"ذِي","d":"dhī","e":"having"},{"c":"ثَلَاثِ","d":"thalāthi","e":"three"},{"c":"شُعَبٍ","d":"shuʿabin","e":"columns"}],"a":{"g":"Proceed to a shadow [of smoke] having three columns"}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"No"},{"c":"ظَلِيلٍ","d":"ẓalīlin","e":"cool shade"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يُغْنِي","d":"yugh'nī","e":"availing"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"against"},{"c":"اللَّهَبِ","d":"l-lahabi","e":"the flame"}],"a":{"g":"[But having] no cool shade and availing not against the flame.\""}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهَا","d":"innahā","e":"Indeed it"},{"c":"تَرْمِي","d":"tarmī","e":"throws up"},{"c":"بِشَرَرٍ","d":"bishararin","e":"sparks"},{"c":"كَالْقَصْرِ","d":"kal-qaṣri","e":"as the fortress"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, it throws sparks [as huge] as a fortress,"}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"كَأَنَّهُ","d":"ka-annahu","e":"As if they (were)"},{"c":"جِمَالَتٌ","d":"jimālatun","e":"camels"},{"c":"صُفْرٌ","d":"ṣuf'run","e":"yellow"}],"a":{"g":"As if they were yellowish [black] camels."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is) a Day"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَنْطِقُونَ","d":"yanṭiqūna","e":"they will speak"}],"a":{"g":"This is a Day they will not speak,"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يُؤْذَنُ","d":"yu'dhanu","e":"will it be permitted"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"فَيَعْتَذِرُونَ","d":"fayaʿtadhirūna","e":"to make excuses"}],"a":{"g":"Nor will it be permitted for them to make an excuse."}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"يَوْمُ","d":"yawmu","e":"(is the) Day"},{"c":"الْفَصْلِ","d":"l-faṣli","e":"(of) Judgment;"},{"c":"جَمَعْنَاكُمْ","d":"jamaʿnākum","e":"We have gathered you"},{"c":"وَالْأَوَّلِينَ","d":"wal-awalīna","e":"and the former (people)"}],"a":{"g":"This is the Day of Judgement; We will have assembled you and the former peoples."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِنْ","d":"fa-in","e":"So if"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"كَيْدٌ","d":"kaydun","e":"a plan"},{"c":"فَكِيدُونِ","d":"fakīdūni","e":"then plan against Me"}],"a":{"g":"So if you have a plan, then plan against Me."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"l-mutaqīna","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"ظِلَالٍ","d":"ẓilālin","e":"shades"},{"c":"وَعُيُونٍ","d":"waʿuyūnin","e":"and springs"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will be among shades and springs"}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"وَفَوَاكِهَ","d":"wafawākiha","e":"And fruits"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"from what"},{"c":"يَشْتَهُونَ","d":"yashtahūna","e":"they desire"}],"a":{"g":"And fruits from whatever they desire,"}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"كُلُوا","d":"kulū","e":"Eat"},{"c":"وَاشْرَبُوا","d":"wa-ish'rabū","e":"and drink"},{"c":"هَنِيئًا","d":"hanīan","e":"(in) satisfaction"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"(to) do"}],"a":{"g":"[Being told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you used to do.\""}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"thus"},{"c":"نَجْزِي","d":"najzī","e":"reward"},{"c":"الْمُحْسِنِينَ","d":"l-muḥ'sinīna","e":"the good-doers"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"كُلُوا","d":"kulū","e":"Eat"},{"c":"وَتَمَتَّعُوا","d":"watamattaʿū","e":"and enjoy yourselves"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"a little;"},{"c":"إِنَّكُمْ","d":"innakum","e":"indeed you"},{"c":"مُجْرِمُونَ","d":"muj'rimūna","e":"(are) criminals"}],"a":{"g":"[O disbelievers], eat and enjoy yourselves a little; indeed, you are criminals."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"قِيلَ","d":"qīla","e":"it is said"},{"c":"لَهُمُ","d":"lahumu","e":"to them"},{"c":"ارْكَعُوا","d":"ir'kaʿū","e":"Bow"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَرْكَعُونَ","d":"yarkaʿūna","e":"they bow"}],"a":{"g":"And when it is said to them, \"Bow [in prayer],\" they do not bow."}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"وَيْلٌ","d":"waylun","e":"Woe"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"لِلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"lil'mukadhibīna","e":"to the deniers"}],"a":{"g":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"فَبِأَيِّ","d":"fabi-ayyi","e":"Then in what"},{"c":"حَدِيثٍ","d":"ḥadīthin","e":"statement"},{"c":"بَعْدَهُ","d":"baʿdahu","e":"after it"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"yu'minūna","e":"will they believe"}],"a":{"g":"Then in what statement after the Qur'an will they believe?"}}}